### PHASE 3 - MINI AUDIT TEST SUITE
### Testing security, role-based access, and public API filtering

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### ===========================================
### 1. PUBLIC ENDPOINTS - No Token Required
### ===========================================

### Test 1.1: Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 1.2: Storefront Home (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/storefront/home
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 1.3: Public Categories (Should show only isActive=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 1.4: Public Products (Should show only ACTIVE, not DRAFT/ARCHIVED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 1.5: Public FAQs (NEW - Should show only isActive=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/faqs
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 2. ADMIN ENDPOINTS - No Token (Should get 401)
### ===========================================

### Test 2.1: Admin Products without token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 2.2: Admin Categories without token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 2.3: Admin FAQs without token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 3. ADMIN WITH CUSTOMER ROLE (Should get 403)
### ===========================================
### Note: This requires a CUSTOMER user token
### You need to create a customer user and login to get their token

### Test 3.1: Login as CUSTOMER (if exists)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
# Content-Type: application/json
# 
# {
#   "email": "customer@example.com",
#   "password": "password123"
# }

### Test 3.2: Admin Products with CUSTOMER token (Expect 403)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ===========================================
### 4. ADMIN WITH ADMIN ROLE (Should work)
### ===========================================
### Note: You need to login as admin first to get the token

### Test 4.1: Login as ADMIN
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
# Content-Type: application/json
# 
# {
#   "email": "admin@digicams.com",
#   "password": "your-admin-password"
# }

### Test 4.2: Admin Products with ADMIN token (Expect 200)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Test 4.3: Admin FAQs with ADMIN token (Expect 200)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===========================================
### 5. DATA FILTERING VALIDATION
### ===========================================

### Test 5.1: Verify ARCHIVED products don't appear in public API
### Steps:
### 1. Use admin endpoint to list all products (including ARCHIVED)
### 2. Use public endpoint to list products (should exclude ARCHIVED)
### 3. Compare results

### Test 5.2: Verify inactive categories don't appear in public API
### Steps:
### 1. Use admin endpoint to list all categories
### 2. Use public endpoint to list categories (should exclude isActive=false)
### 3. Compare results

### Test 5.3: Verify inactive FAQs don't appear in public API
### Steps:
### 1. Use admin endpoint to list all FAQs
### 2. Use public endpoint to list FAQs (should exclude isActive=false)
### 3. Compare results

### Test 5.4: Verify stock cannot be negative
### POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/:productId/variants/:variantId/stock
### Body: { "stock": -5 }
### Expected: 400 Bad Request with validation error

### ===========================================
### AUDIT CHECKLIST
### ===========================================
# [ ] Build passes: npm run build
# [ ] Unit tests pass: npm run test
# [ ] E2E tests pass: npm run test:e2e
# [ ] Public endpoints work without token
# [ ] Admin endpoints require authentication (401 without token)
# [ ] Admin endpoints reject CUSTOMER role (403)
# [ ] Admin endpoints allow ADMIN role (200)
# [ ] ARCHIVED products hidden from public
# [ ] Inactive categories hidden from public
# [ ] Inactive FAQs hidden from public
# [ ] Negative stock rejected
# [ ] Product cannot publish in inactive category
# [ ] Category cannot be deleted if has products
